.TH "JSONKIT\-STATS\-DEPTH" "1" "" "jsonkit 0.0.0" ""
.SH "NAME"
jsonkit\-stats\-depth \- Measure how deeply the document nests.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBjsonkit stats depth\fR <command> [options]
.fi
.SH "COMMANDS"
.TP
\fBmax\fR
Print the deepest nesting level under a path.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBjsonkit\fR(1), \fBjsonkit\-stats\fR(1), \fBjsonkit\-stats\-depth\-max\fR(1)
